    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（中甲），非普通</em><br />穿着這套護甲期間，你可以以附贈動作讓這套護甲向四周釋放出劇毒的孢子，孢子將充滿以你爲中心的10尺半徑球狀區域。任何在這片區域內的生物都必須通過一次[[/save ability=con dc=15]]豁免，豁免失敗將陷入 <strong>中毒Poisoned</strong> 狀態，持續直至你的下一回合結束。此屬性一旦被使用，直到次日黎明前都無法被再次使用。</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">釘刺甲是一種罕見的中甲，它們出自矮人工匠之手，造型看上去像是覆蓋了金屬尖刺的皮革外套和護腿。</span></p><p>While wearing this armor, you can take a bonus action to make the armor emit poisonous spores, which fill a 10-foot-radius sphere centered on yourself. Each creature in that area must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=15]] saving throw or have the poisoned condition until the end of your next turn. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p><p>Spiked armor is a rare type of medium armor made by dwarves. It consists of a leather coat and leggings covered with spikes that are usually made of metal.</p></div>",
